Package: clofix-release
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CloFix <support@clofix.com>
Depends: base-files
Description: CloFix Linux release branding and CLI
 Owns CloFix-managed branding files and the clofix(1) CLI so Ubuntu
 package upgrades do not silently replace CloFix identity without
 this package.
Homepage: https://clofix.com/
